{
  "_README": "VIDEO SCENARIO fixture -- see docs/video/PLAN.md. TRIMMED 17 Oct from 193 to 42 entries (35 live + 7 deliberately expired). The full surface saturated routing: swept over all 306 ordered pairs of 18 Dhaka landmarks, only 2 produced a route the app could recommend with nothing on it, and every pair with a wider flag spread carried 4-7 flags on the recommendation as well -- which reads as 'both routes are bad' and is the one claim segment 3 exists to make. Built for the pair 'Gulshan 2 -> Rampura': the 0 flags sitting on its recommended corridor are removed, the 6 on its worst alternative are kept, and the rest is filled by farthest-point sampling so the map stays evenly covered rather than clustered. STATUS: every newsroom-sourced entry states 'confirmed'. The loader defaults status to 'unconfirmed', which predates the 2026-10-16 rule -- since then a vetted newsroom's word is enough on its own and 'unconfirmed' means a community report with no newsroom behind it (app/policy/independence.py VETTED_PUBLISHERS). source_count is 2 where it was 1 so confirmation also holds through the independent-publisher branch, leaving tests/invariants/test_confirmation_requires_a_vetted_source.py green without touching policy. Still unconfirmed, correctly: seed-mugda-utility (a Titas notice is not a newsroom) if present, and the seed-expired-* rows. Load with: python backend/scripts/stage_video.py",
